 end="04:16.920"><span begin="04:15.480" end="04:15.660">And </span><span begin="04:15.660" end="04:15.780">it's </span><span begin="04:15.780" end="04:15.960">been </span><span begin="04:15.960" end="04:16.920">awhile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:17.250" end="04:20.190"><span begin="04:17.250" end="04:17.700">Since </span><span begin="04:17.700" end="04:17.970">I </span><span begin="04:17.970" end="04:18.420">said </span><span begin="04:18.420" end="04:18.570">I'm </span><span begin="04:18.570" end="04:20.190">sorry</span></p></div></body></tt>